<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Battle Tower... It’s SO tall!\nHow many of me stacked is that?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Every spot in the Battle Frontier\nlet you team with a homie!\fThat’s hard, don’t you think?\fI wish I had a homie to run with...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m THE super Idol of Johto!\rI came all the way to the\nBattle Frontier to promote my\fnew single!\rBut...\rEverybody here a Poké Maniac!\nNot one of ’em streamed it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Fishin’ don’t calm me down no more\nsince I found the Battle Frontier.\fI go fishin’, then I dip early\fand end up here. Every. Time.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My fave spot outta the five\nfacilities is the\fBattle Castle, ’cause you can\fsee Lady Caitlin there! She fine!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What make me happiest bein’\na Hustler?\rThe fact that homies always\nbring me more homies!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Just like people go through stuff\nand learn from it, homies\flearn from scraps.\rBehind every scrap, there’s a\nstory. Ain’t that right, dear?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Every scrap lead to a story.\nI ain’t wrong, am I, dear?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I came to the Battle Frontier\nlookin’ for a job!\rThanks to my last job, I’m nice\nat cookin’, cleanin’, and laundry!\fDon’t ask what kinda cookin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">To be strong is to be weak.\nTo be weak is to be strong.\rSomebody told me that once.\nI still don’t get it,\fbut it SOUND deep.\rI’mma give myself some time\nto figure it out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Seein’ people who care this much\nabout their homies make me feel bad\fabout bein’ selfish.\rI’mma try and be there for my\nhomies for real now!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How many years since I first met\na homie? ...Forty-nine!\rOh, I lost the page that kept\ntrack of the years, days, and hours...\rCould my homies be chewin’ on it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hustlers look out for their homies\nas the scrap go on.\rIn return, homies pay that trust\nback by goin’ all out.\rWhat you see in a scrap is the trust\nbetween people and homies.\rSound obvious, but it’s actually\nhonestly crazy!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can’t try nothin’ if you\nscared of losin’ scraps.\rBut!\rJumpin’ in a scrap knowin’ you got\nno chance just make your\fhomies suffer.\rThat ain’t courage!\nReal Hustlers know the balance\fbetween guts and bein’ smart.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you tryna graduate from bein’\na mid Hustler, listen up!\rThe homie’s type!\rThe moves it learn!\rThe items it hold!\rYou can’t sleep on NONE of it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When people win a scrap, some\nlaugh at the other guy.\rSome brag about how strong they.\rSome even start dancin’ around\nclaimin’ they number one\fin the world.\rI respect people who win and then\ncheck on the other guy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You heard of the Brains of the\nBattle Frontier?\rThere’s five facilities in the\nBattle Frontier.\rAt every one, you can win your way\nup to challenge the bosses\fcalled the Frontier Brains.\fThey out-of-this-world tough!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lettin’ us enjoy scraps,\nhelpin’ us work,\ftakin’ us places far away,\for just bein’ good homies...\rHomies is so deep.\nI wanna be like a homie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At the Battle Factory, you gotta\nkeep winnin’ with rental homies.\rI might not stand a chance at the\nother facilities, but here I\fmight go all the way!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Hall is where homies\nscrap one-on-one for as long as\fthey can.\rEven my MAGIKARP got a shot at\nnumber one!\rSheesh!\rJust thinkin’ about it\nget me hype!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Life full of ups and downs.\nI keep my pool floatie close.\rCall it the wisdom I got from\nthe last five years of my life.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Exchange Service\nCorner!\rYou wanna cash in your BP\nfor some prizes? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back whenever!\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} gon’ cost {STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0} BP.\nThat cool? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0} gon’\ncost {STRVAR_1 51, 2, 0} BP.\fThat cool? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You put the {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}\nin the {STRVAR_1 18, 1, 0} Pocket.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, but you ain’t got\nenough BP. You broke.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, but your Bag full.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pick the TM you\nwant. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0100_D32_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pick the item you\nwant. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
